     "body": "<p>Fixed in 6f500ad5bd71e22d5549833abb1b471235e96df5.</p>\n\n<p>FYI, for Jetty 6.x, creating a contexts/fedora.xml with the following contents will do (substituting your own relative path to FEDORA_HOME for \"fedora/default\"):</p>\n\n<p>&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"  encoding=\"ISO-8859-1\"?&gt;<br/>\n&lt;!DOCTYPE Configure PUBLIC \"-//Mort Bay Consulting//DTD Configure//EN\" \"http://jetty.mortbay.org/configure.dtd\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;Configure class=\"org.mortbay.jetty.webapp.WebAppContext\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;Set name=\"contextPath\"&gt;/fedora&lt;/Set&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;Set name=\"war\"&gt;&lt;SystemProperty name=\"jetty.home\" default=\".\"/&gt;/webapps/fedora&lt;/Set&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;Set name=\"initParams\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;Map&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;Entry&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;Item&gt;fedora.home&lt;/Item&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;Item&gt;&lt;SystemProperty name=\"jetty.home\" default=\".\"/&gt;/fedora/default&lt;/Item&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;/Entry&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;/Map&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/Set&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/Configure&gt;</p>",
     "created": "23/Jul/11 12:52 AM",
     "id": "12018",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10947/comment/12018",
